  "title": "Yellow Spicy Egyptian Lentil Tagine",
  "description": "A citrusy and springy Egyptian dish featuring mixed spice and lacto-vegetarian-friendly ingredients, perfect for a crowd-pleasing meal. It is made by pounding spices in a mortar and pestle.",
