  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is softened.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the ground cumin, smoked paprika, cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the red lentils, vegetable broth, and lemon juice and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 30 minutes.",
    "Use a mortar and pestle to pound the spices and add them to the pot.",
    "Simmer for an additional 10 minutes.",
    "Serve hot over rice or with pita bread."
  ],
